  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/IMG_4113.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La comisi&oacute;n de fiestas de Torrechiva ha organizado este viernes una comida en los bajos del Ayuntamiento de deliciosa olla de cardos, con motivo de a festividad de la Inmaculada.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/IMG_4144.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha amenizado la sobremesa el grupo de flamenquito ondense De Calle y por la noche ha habido discom&oacute;vil.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4099.jpg\" alt=\"img_4099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4101.jpg\" alt=\"img_4101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4106.jpg\" alt=\"img_4106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4107.jpg\" alt=\"img_4107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4108.jpg\" alt=\"img_4108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4109.jpg\" alt=\"img_4109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4110.jpg\" alt=\"img_4110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ollainmaculadatorrechiva/img_4111.jpg\" alt=\"img_4111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"http